nThis is a one-time purchase. No subscriptions. No fluff. Just facts, support, and sanity.--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nIntroducing Katie & Harriet of Nugget Savings (https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/say-hello-katie-harriet-nugget-savings-working-families-bqwne)\nciteturn83search8 [wordlim: 200] Published: 1.5 years ago; Crawled: 2 weeks ago; \n\nImage: Introducing Katie & Harriet of Nugget Savings\n\n# Introducing Katie & Harriet of Nugget Savings\n\nWorking Families\n\n### Working Families\n\n#### We are the UK’s national charity for working parents and carers.\n\nPublished Apr 15, 2025\n\nWe're thrilled to share that this month's newsletter has been taken over by Katie Guild and Harriet M. co-founders of Nugget Savings . With over 1 million likes and 250K followers across their socials, there is a strong chance that you will have heard of Nugget Savings. Their need-to-know, myth-busting content is helping parents plan and prep for a financially secure parental leave.\n\n## Three Nuggets of Parental Leave Wisdom\n\nHi, we’re Katie and Harriet, co-founders of Nugget Savings . We’re on a mission to transform parental leave in the UK and eventually worldwide. \n\nOur platform helps parents navigate their finances through the first years of parenthood. --------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nNUGGET SAVINGS LIMITED overview - Find and update company information - GOV.UK (https://find-and-update.company-information.service.gov.uk/company/15063887)\nciteturn83search9 [wordlim: 200] Published: 3.2 years ago; Crawled: 5 months ago; \n\n# NUGGET SAVINGS LIMITED\n\nCompany number 15063887\n\nRegistered office address\n    Studio 304 Ladywell Works, 15 Whitburn Road, London, England, SE13 7UQ\n\nCompany status\n    Active\n\nCompany type\n    Private limited Company\n\nIncorporated on\n    10 August 2023\n\n## Accounts\n\nNext accounts made up to 31 March 2026\ndue by 31 December 2026\n\nLast accounts made up to 31 March 2025\n\n## Confirmation statement\n\nNext statement date 9 August 2026\ndue by 23 August 2026\n\nLast statement dated 9 August 2025\n\n## Nature of business (SIC)\n\n  * 62012 - Business and domestic software development\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nAbout 4 — Nugget Savings (https://www.nuggetsavings.com/about-nugget)\nciteturn83search10 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 3 weeks ago; \nShe’d heard from a mutual friend that I had ideas bubbling away about maternity pay, and we connected.\n\nThe Nugget journey began with us posting on social media and within a few months, we’d gained thousands of followers. It was obvious: there was a huge gap in the market for honest, practical education around parental leave. \n\nWe had big ideas for what we wanted to build. But before we could do any of it, we realised there was a vital missing piece: education, support and transparency. \n\nWhen we first told people about Nugget, we were hit with:\n\n “Why can’t I just Google that?”\n\nWell… yeah, you can.\n\nBut you’re here because you already know that Googling can lead to:\n\n  * Conflicting answers\n\n  * Advice that’s hard to understand\n\n  * Legal jargon that makes your head spin\n\n  * A million tabs open and still no closer to clarity\n\nIt’s confusing. It’s overwhelming. And it’s hard to know what actually applies to you.\n\nSo where do you turn when you’re just so bloody confused and maybe even too nervous to ask HR?\n\nThat’s exactly why we built Nugget.\n\nWe exist to make parental leave and the transition to parenthood less overwhelming financially, emotionally, and practically.\n\nWe believe everyone deserves clear information, better support, and a community that gets it.--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nHarriet Morton-Liddle (https://discover.circle.so/harriet-morton-liddle)\nciteturn83search11 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 3 weeks ago; \n\n# Harriet Morton-Liddle\n\n@harriet-morton-liddle\n\nFinancial Educator | Helping parents navigate maternity pay & parental leave\n\nWebsiteLinkedIn\n\nJoined February 2026\n\n## About\n\nI'm Harriet, founder of Nugget Savings. I started Nugget when I noticed friends and colleagues panicking about the financial side of having kids. They'd say things like \"my maternity pay is rubbish\" or \"I have no idea how we'll manage\" and I realised that even though I'd always been financially savvy and saved for every eventuality, I'd never once thought about what having a baby would actually look like financially.\n\nThat didn't sit right with me. So I started digging into UK maternity pay, parental leave, employer policies, childcare funding - ALL OF IT! And I found a mess of confusing government websites, outdated advice, and parents piecing it together alone.\n\nNugget exists to fix that. We help parents understand exactly what they're entitled to, maximise their income, and feel in control during one of life's biggest transitions.\n\n## Products\n\nNugget Savings The go-to community for navigating maternity pay, parental leave & the finances of early parenthood$39.72/year"
